Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=24}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji!\N– Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.51,0:02:08.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:14.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my new home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He isn't spewing\Nblood everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I guess he's better now.\NI don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks. I wanna swim too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can. All we have to do\Nis get you a bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! We can have\None made in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:33.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he had a nosebleed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be able\Nto do a transfusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji's blood type is\Nrare, and we're all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Camie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:45.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While I'm here,\Nthere's somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd really like to see,\Nif we can find them somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Don't tell me,\Nthe Mermaid Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. It's Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:58.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They call him "Boss" down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, when you say "Jinbe,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:02.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're talking about\Nthe Warlord, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or, I mean, {\i1}"former Warlord"{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since he resigned after\Nthe whole war thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a\Ngood friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Him {\i1}and{\i0} the\NPirate Empress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You make some weird friends\Nwhen we're not around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}When Ace died two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I had a tough time\Npullin' it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}In fact, I doubt I'd\Neven be here right now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}if it wasn't for his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to talk to him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,See you on Fishman\NIsland in two years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:29.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Be sure to bring your\Nentire crew along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I look forward to\Nmeeting everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said to meet here,\Nand there's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\NI heard he went
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:39.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to Marineford with you\Nwhen you rang that bell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and everyone got all worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know where\Nwe can find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's kinda tricky,\N'cause Boss doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,exactly live on the island\Nwith everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since he resigned\Nfrom the Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they have to treat him\Nlike a normal pirate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means all the\NFishman Pirates can't stay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the city anymore, so they\Nfound a new place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not too far from\Nhere, but that's where
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll have to go if\Nyou want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:09.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a pain.\NThis place has some dumb rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know it seems\Nweird, but even though
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:13.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're all the way down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the War of the Best\Nended up affecting us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Camie!\N– Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Camie!\N– Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– There's a big ship coming!\N– Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a ship from the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but maybe nobody's on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.\NOf course someone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:30.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, did you see somebody\Non the ship or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it was for sure\Nthe royal family's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't usually\Ncome around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they've come\Nhere to arrest Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause he didn't enter\Nthe city the right way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what if they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys had better hide\Nbefore they get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:44.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, quick. This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's right. That ship's\Nthe royal gondola.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I knew!\N– Maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:04:59.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, I doubt anyone\Nfrom the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is actually riding on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:05.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This corner of the\Nisland's sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,out of the way for them,\Nso they don't usually bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attention, all citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The three Neptune\NBrothers have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Greetings, ladies of the cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:31.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I hope that you can\Nanswer an inquiry of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The princes are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ask me! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have princes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:39.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,U-Uh–
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hide here and stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I received a report that someone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}entered the city illegally.\NHave they come by here, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If they have,\Nand you've seen them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}be sure to tell\N♪ me-fa-so-la-ti-do! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Mambo! Mambo!\NShakey, shakey moon fish! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Why we gotta do this?\NLet's party with the ladies! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we haven't\Nseen anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They sound like common thugs.\NAre they really {\i1}that{\i0} important?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely they don't\Ndemand the attention
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of princes such as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:19.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have yet to ascertain\Ntheir identities,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so it may be too early\Nto say just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ He doesn't know la-ti-do! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Let's dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Ain't no party\Nlike a mambo party! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's all this commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, it's the\Nprinces from Neptune's army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a pain\Nin the ass. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see how it plays out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:52.36,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Mambo, mambo, shake it! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. I see. Well,\NI thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shall search elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:07:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for\Ninterrupting your leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll dance again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ And away we go-la-ti-do! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:08.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Bye-bye!\N– Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the border guards\Nwere just seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soft– So soft–
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big boobie! Big boobie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was too much blood!\NHe needs help, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that pent-up lust\Nlet loose in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. No mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the pirate,\NStraw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ammo Knights, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Yes, sir!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.93,0:08:06.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, look at than.\NHow convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno. The guards\Nare gonna catch 'em first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our orders are clear,\Nbut we don't wanna
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,start crap with\Nthe Neptune Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a second... Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can sort out\Nour crimes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but right now,\Nthere's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our friend has lost\Na lot of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we need a donor quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:28.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you leave him here,\Nor throw him in jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he'll be dead within an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His blood type is S RH negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know it's rare, but does\Nsomeone here have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone? Fishmen\Nand humans do have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the same kind of\Nblood, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:43.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! We are not\Nlosing you over this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes!\NI can't let my friend die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper-chin. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:59.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishmen and humans {\i1}do{\i0} have\Nthe same kind of blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the situation is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:02.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing is—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a load of these humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:12.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really are\Nstupid, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you a big enough\Njerk the last time we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His name is Hammond, sir.\NHe's from the Fishman District.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not getting a damned drop
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from anybody on this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would we share our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with disgusting\Ncreatures like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't worth\Na {\i1}thing{\i0} down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:32.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And even if someone\N{\i1}did{\i0} help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,decent fishmen like us,\Nwho hate humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would make sure they\Nwere punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Punished"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can bleed out\Nright here, for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Many fishmen would\Nhappily watch him die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a law\Nfor this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One we've followed\Nfor a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishmen are forbidden to\Nshare blood with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:53.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That law sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:10:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, it was {\i1}humans{\i0} who set\Nthe rule in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our blood may be the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:04.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but for ages, you've\Ntreated us like monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or worse, like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your blood was too good for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, that's why\NFisher Tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the hero of this island, died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:17.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said that name... once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He fought to\Nfree slaves of all races,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and when that battle took\Nits toll on his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when he lied bloody\Nand battered,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not a single human\Nwould offer their blood
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to return his kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A transfusion\Nwould've saved him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but 'cause of humans, he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So right now, you\Nhave but one choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not much\Nof a choice, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friend is going to die,\Nand you're coming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the Fishman District with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:47.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hody Jones, the captain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the New Fishman Pirates,\Nis expecting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he doesn't like to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.47,0:10:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, who cares about some stupid\Nrule in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to\Nlisten to this thug!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's someone's life\Non the line here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything it\Ntakes to repay you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time\Nto get stuck on pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:11.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come along, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Second Gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take you by\Nforce if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Trawl Net!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not joining\Nyour stupid crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jet Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing is too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My word, he made\Nquick work of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It just gave up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:57.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess Luffy can tame\Nsea monsters now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened? That was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chin! Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring Sanji-chin up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:13.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll go back to town!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's lots of humans there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so might be able to\Nfind a blood donor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.37,0:12:19.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:20.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool! Ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.37,0:12:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure. We need\Nto head over to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mosu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't do that!\NIt belongs to the princes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:46.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll bring your ship back\Nas soon as we save Sanji-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:48.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And away they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,get home now? So-la-ti-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:12:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything in the\Nworld to save his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I don't have\Nthe right blood type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing for\Nyou to feel bad about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he wasn't such a perv,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this wouldn't have happened\Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's dying and he's still\Nthinking about boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So bouncy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So soft and bouncy and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! You're in\Na delicate state!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.68,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So soft and bouncy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you keep thinking\Nabout dirty stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're gonna lose what\Nlittle blood you have left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We may be friends,\Nbut considering the way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you and Hachi got\Ntreated back on Sabaody,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should've guessed something\Nlike this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's some deep-rooted\Nstuff going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And to be honest,\NI dunno how this'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no promise anyone'll\Nhelp us back in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're counting on\Nhuman donors for blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I haven't seen any\Nat all this past month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, your ship\Nis the first one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we've had in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why? I thought everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,had to come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it wasn't\Nlike this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody can say for\Ncertain, but we think
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,someone's attacking\Nthe travelers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like what happened\Nwith you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something going\Non in this kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I have a sinking feeling\Nit's about to get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:07.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, ladies,\Nyou must be forthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you try to conceal\Nthose pirates from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, Prince.\NThey aren't bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds like what happened\Nwasn't their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're Camie's friends,\Nand they got split up
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from their crew,\Nso we didn't want them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to be thrown in jail\Nas soon as they got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:25.82,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't be sad...\Neverybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope they\Nfind a donor for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, you misunderstood us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have different\Nbusiness with them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their method of entry\Nis no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would only be\Na small formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't consider them\Nenemies, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have different\Nbusiness with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Re-mi-fa-so-la-ti ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then this is all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We... had a message\Nto pass on to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:50.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:14:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that barrel over there\Nis the one that drifted
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in with all Camie's\Nfriends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's in it? Maybe treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's sealed pretty tightly,\Nso it's gotta be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? I think we should open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me too. What if it\Nneeds to go in the fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pulled through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're safe in a town\Nright by the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You almost lost all\Nthe blood in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'd never find you a donor.\NThat was a real close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That so? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be\Nsitting up so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, the fish\Ncould've given blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But no, instead we had\Nto run all over town
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,looking for another human,\Nwhich took forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was starting\Nto lose hope there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I appreciate what\Nyou did, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I just don't remember much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where was I, and\Nwhat was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I think about it,\Nit's all a big blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Let it go already!\N– Let it go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you try to force the\Nmemories, you could relapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I almost\Nforgot, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You haven't met your donors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, here. Say "hi."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could my savior have\Nbeen {\i1}a dainty girl{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:46.14,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We're only human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:50.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, if we don't look out\Nfor each other, who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– ...we can give you more!\N– ...we can give you more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's\Nback to his old self!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not exactly gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I see the cut on your\Narm for a second, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's positive. Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that wound's poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That musta been the\Nsting I felt earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the fishmen got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't seem poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way,\Nwe should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This stuff's probably deadly.\NYou sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow. So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds crazy, but you\Nmust have somehow developed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,an antibody to fight against\Nthis kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you ever experienced a\Npoisoning like this in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, back when\NI was at Impel Down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I almost got killed that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is... not funny... at all{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet it was that\Noctopus swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, he blocked my punch.\NSo he's gotta be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:21.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No prob. Next time,\NI'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:36.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think that came\Nfrom by that cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't care. I've got\Nbigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys are\Nmessed up real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:46.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And what's worse,\NStraw Hat got poisoned too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm dead if he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I heard their\Nscreams come from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ishilly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Where are you?\N– Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where I saw them last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But where in the world\Ncould they have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did anyone else\Nhear them say something
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about opening up a barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy-chin,\NUsopp-chin, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's someone I'd\Nlike you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's the owner of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She okayed Sanji resting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.08,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Madam Sharley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool, thanks and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Has the blond\Nboy's condition improved at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But it's best he doesn't meet\Nyou because you're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:31.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right? That would be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, we probably\Nshouldn't tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's in the back\Nof the Mermaid Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not if we want him to get well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:39.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why keep it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause doctor's orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper's pretty sure that\Nif Sanji-chin finds out,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's gonna have a bad relapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a strange prognosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, big lady!\NFish lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! That was rude. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me what this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}also{\i0} not\Non the list of things
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:19:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're allowed to touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're looking at Madam\NSharley's crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With it, she can see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her precognitive visions\Nare why she's famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it used to be.\NNot anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The future isn't ours\Nto know. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, how do\Nmermaids take a dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are not talking about\Nmermaid poop again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any\NCLAAAASS?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, apologize! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sorry.\N– Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:37.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take\Nthe rest of the day off, Camie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think your friends would\Nappreciate a tour of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You deserve it, seeing as\Nyou're always working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, business has been slow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with human guests so\Nuncommon these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we have to be\Nextra good hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The girls from the cove\Nshould show up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we'll have more hands\Naround here than a starfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:21:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"More than... starfish?"\NOh, that's right! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should have already delivered\NPappag's clams by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow. I have no idea\Nwhat's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet he's getting mad\Nwaiting for his food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not quite. He's\Nenjoying the café.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An old friend of his\Nsuddenly came into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they've been living\Nit up since he arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Well, that makes things easy.\N– Well, that makes things easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't wanna bring\Nthis up in front of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Madam told me\Na lot of stories
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from when she was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She said, in those days,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,human pirates came to\Nthe island all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that was quite a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,About a year before the\NGreat Pirate Era began.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard for her to\Ntalk about things sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Especially when she\Nforesees bad stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like the war at Marineford\Nand Whitebeard's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine knowing\Nsomething horrible will happen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:56.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that you can't stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That must be terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:21:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:01.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, he said he\Nwas gonna hang out here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and look after Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, you two! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– 'Kay!\N– 'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're on\Nwhat's considered
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.46,0:22:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coral Hill's main street.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:15.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that is the primary\Nentrance to the Mermaid Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man! Thought I was\Ngonna starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They might only serve snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:23.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got cakes and\Nsea fruit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We merfolk don't really\Neat meat and fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we have wakame brûlée,\Nmozuku tarts, kelp soufflé...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call that food?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! We do have some meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.49,0:22:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From shellfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scallop sandwiches,\Nclam pizza, and–
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those give meat a bad name!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.85,0:22:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Okay. Be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.46,0:22:50.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's all\Ngo find Pappag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shellfish! What the hell\Nkind of crap is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.47,0:22:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Thank you very much!\N– Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:22:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.15,0:23:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to give the dogfish a {\i1}bone{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta love the fans, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, it's Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.74,0:23:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Luffy and Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And {\i1}Camie{\i0}, you've become\Nsuch a lovely young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.98,0:23:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\Nmuch I've missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you\Ntell me you were coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pappag!\NSorry it's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes you Pappag's\Nold friend we heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come see us again! 'Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had a great time, Soul King!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.13,0:23:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be back,\Nlovely ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.90,0:23:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lots of bones to go around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.53,0:23:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.67,0:23:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've gone limp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't. Ha!\NSkeletons are always rigid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, good thing I'm already dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or I would probably die\Nof embarrassment right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Oh, you!\N– Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:52.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This café has really\Nput Brook in rare form.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever's goin' on\Ninside must be awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.89,0:23:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up there, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.65,0:23:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.75,0:23:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're ya in such a hurry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you're interested\Nin the café, and I get that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.26,0:24:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's not like\Nit's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's come back when\Nyou have your whole crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone-Daddy and I were just\Nabout to head back to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you do, you can eat all\Nthe sea king meat you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:17.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you say "meat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did! I'm a wild\Nanimal! Ya feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:23.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like I eat\Nboring shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.06,0:24:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need food with\Na little more bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea monster exclusive diet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I brought your order of clams!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.48,0:24:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweet! My favorite\Ntreat is finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.37,0:24:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! So much for your diet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.22,0:24:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.30,0:24:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, merfolk are the only\Nones who don't eat meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.71,0:24:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishmen eat the stuff\Nall the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.46,0:24:43.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's not like you\Ncan't get it here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.05,0:24:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's just not as common.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.66,0:24:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, it's about\Ntime one of them showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.73,0:24:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:24:58.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken!\NThought so!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.36,0:25:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why is there a wanted\Nposter for a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.88,0:25:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.56,0:25:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this guy on the\Nhaunted ship we saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw him? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.12,0:25:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.60,0:25:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our nation's been looking\Nfor him for years now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The dude's a pirate and\Na no-good undersea thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.27,0:25:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you all\Nabout it on the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's load up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.61,0:25:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Story goes, Vander\NDecken was hard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The guy was totally\Nhead-over-heels
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for the Mermaid Princess\Nof the Ryugu Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.04,0:25:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was so desperate,\Nhe sent love letters daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.71,0:25:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stalkery, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.76,0:25:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gave up letters. Started sending\Ngifts instead. Then threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– So soft and fluffy!\N– So soft and fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanted to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Feels great!\N– Feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.18,0:25:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And springy! Bouncy! Bouncy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.40,0:25:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sure!\N– Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.83,0:25:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.90,0:25:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahem. Because his advances\Nstarted to become so violent,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Mermaid Princess got scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.28,0:25:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so of course, the stalker\Nbecame a national concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:26:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! But that was\Njust the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her father,\NKing Neptune, got mad,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,which led to him sending the\Nthree princes you saw earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.50,0:26:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,off to hunt Vander Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.99,0:26:09.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even with the army,\Nthey can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.68,0:26:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon, Camie.\NYou stole all my thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.52,0:26:15.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way! King Neptune's\Nthe God of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.96,0:26:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus he's in control\Nof this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.96,0:26:19.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's not enough\Nresponsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.88,0:26:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he has four children\Nto take care of!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.06,0:26:24.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Mermaid Princess\Nis the youngest,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.34,0:26:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so, obviously, the three\Nprinces are the older kids
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.78,0:26:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.90,0:26:30.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great. But, something\Nstill doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken must be quite ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.51,0:26:35.18,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.18,0:26:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he isn't a ghost, I imagine\Nhe's a few hundred years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.53,0:26:39.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.75,0:26:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.60,0:26:42.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.92,0:26:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is, unless,\Nyou ignore the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.17,0:26:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now there's no denying\Nthat he existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.22,0:26:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the truth of the matter is\Nthat the legendary sea captain
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.09,0:26:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken died sometime\Nafter he arrived here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.94,0:26:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on Fishman Island and hasn't\Nbeen heard from since.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.56,0:26:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That said, the ship\Nyou say you saw
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:02.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,probably was the\NFlying Dutchman, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.01,0:27:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's his descendant\Nwho's on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.81,0:27:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's–
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.36,0:27:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's Vander Decken the Ninth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.65,0:27:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wow! That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.78,0:27:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.82,0:27:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}it's a relief to find out\Nhe's not a ghost after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Believing we had come\Ninto contact with someone
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.54,0:27:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the afterlife was making me\Ncontemplate my own mortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And considering I'm a skeleton,\NI don't have much of that left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.87,0:27:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell\Nan exciting story.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man. I thought\Nmerfolk and fishmen
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.57,0:27:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all looked the same, but the\Nmore I see, the less they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.17,0:27:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check out those\Nold ones down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.93,0:27:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their fins are split\Nlike Granny Kokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.37,0:27:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See those babies?\NRight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll notice\Nthe father is a fishman,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the children are\Na mix of both species.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.84,0:27:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because when\Na mermaid and a fishman
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,love each other very much\Nand decide to get busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.58,0:27:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,their kids can come out\Nlooking like either parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.97,0:27:57.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's why they\Nall look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.50,0:27:59.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.17,0:28:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, we finally\Nmade it to the highway!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is fast!\NWhat's up with that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. Nothing,\Nit's a candy factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.21,0:28:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:15.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then why's there\Na pirate flag on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.08,0:28:17.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that? That flag's\Neverywhere here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.28,0:28:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the entrance and the\Nharbor. It's a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And for good reason at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.63,0:28:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It symbolizes that\Nwe're protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.23,0:28:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'see, the flag belongs\Nto a famous pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.95,0:28:29.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,named Charlotte Linlin\Nof the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But she's better known as Big\NMom, one of the Four Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa. That's no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah. Back before\Nthe war in Marineford,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.34,0:28:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard was this\Nisland's guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now that he's dead, someone\Nelse had to take his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.89,0:28:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that someone\Nhappened to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.10,0:28:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing is, she\Ndemands a whole ton of candy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.97,0:28:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in exchange for her services.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.90,0:28:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hence the factory\Nthat you just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.96,0:28:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.15,0:28:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This country wouldn't\Nbe able to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:28:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without the protection of\Npowerful people like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.69,0:29:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, this is a dangerous\Nplace where pirates come and go,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.59,0:29:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and more often than not,\Nthey {\i1}aren't{\i0} very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.09,0:29:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.26,0:29:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's filling in\Nwhere Whitebeard left off,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so that's gotta mean she's\Na good person, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.22,0:29:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Depends on how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.81,0:29:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard never\Nasked for anything
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.34,0:29:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in return for his protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.91,0:29:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,treats it like a business\Nrather than a charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An Emperor. Like Shanks! Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.07,0:29:24.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hope I get to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.79,0:29:26.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyes forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.36,0:29:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where all the\Ncelebrity types live:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.73,0:29:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishverly Hills!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.62,0:29:34.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That tall building right\Nin front is Pappag's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.17,0:29:35.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.66,0:29:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– All that for one starfish?\N– All that for one starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.87,0:29:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.56,0:29:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let this happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:51.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Madam Sharley\Nfrom the café.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.46,0:29:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NPlease. Please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.90,0:29:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Why are you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.81,0:29:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something must be done.\NNow, before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Sure. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find him!\NThe pirate boy in a straw hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.18,0:30:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.40,0:30:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must leave the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.02,0:30:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now! There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.86,0:30:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. You're having\Na premonition?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swore I wouldn't\Nuse this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.20,0:30:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But something about\Nthat boy felt off to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.81,0:30:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I had no choice\Nbut to look into the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.17,0:30:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen?!\NTell us! What did you see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.31,0:30:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sharley! Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.43,0:30:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.40,0:30:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.38,0:30:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm wrong,\Nand that it won't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.43,0:30:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw him clearly,\Nsurrounded by flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.13,0:30:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because of Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.84,0:30:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island,\Nour country will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.93,0:31:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,destroyed!
